flowchart TD
  accTitle: A bounded asynchronous video job
  accDescr: Submit one generation request, persist its task ID, wait and check status, then save a successful output. Failures and deadlines stop the loop without silently submitting another paid task.
  A["Validated input and authorized budget"] --> B["Submit generation once"]
  B --> C["Persist task ID and attempt record"]
  C --> D["Wait with a bounded interval"]
  D --> E["Retrieve status for this task ID"]
  E --> F{"Status"}
  F -->|Pending or running| G{"Deadline reached?"}
  G -->|No| D
  G -->|Yes| H["Record timeout; preserve task ID"]
  F -->|Failed or canceled| I["Record failure for review"]
  F -->|Succeeded| J["Retrieve and save output file"]
  J --> K["Review before assembly or publication"]
